# Ship to production by default

When the requested work is done and verified, put it on production. Do not wait for “súbelo” or “¿ya está en productivo?”.

1. Commit, open a PR, merge to `main`, and wait until the admin Vercel deploy succeeds.
2. Reply with the production URL when it is live.
3. Skip shipping only if they say to keep it local / not yet, or if the work is unfinished, broken, or blocked.
4. Do not commit secrets or force-push to `main`.
